      <p class="lede-p">They all lighten your hair. They all cost about the same. So why does picking the right one matter? Because each one creates a fundamentally different LOOK — and getting talked into the wrong one means three weeks of disappointment before you can come back.</p>

      <p>I'm going to break down the three most-requested lightening services we do at Romy Salon — what each one is, what it looks like, who it's best for, and how often you'll need to maintain it. By the end of this article, you'll know exactly what to ask for at your next color appointment.</p>

      <h2>The short version (if you only read this far)</h2>

      <div class="compare-mini">
